      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound and painful way to feel, but you are not alone in experiencing this kind of erosion, even if it feels like the world is ending. Sometimes, the most radical act of resistance is simply refusing to let the story of your life end before it has a chance to begin. You don't have to be the one to fight the slow-motion crash; you can just be the one holding the flashlight in the dark.",
